Open Banking & Multi-Currency Exchange Rate Sync Engine
1. Purpose

The system collects, validates, stores, and serves real-time foreign exchange rates for a simulated cross-border payment platform.

The objective is to build a production-like data platform demonstrating:

Data ingestion
Stream processing
Data quality validation
Caching
Monitoring
API development
